<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka bourse to launch screen trading on Aug 11.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka bourse to launch screen trading on Aug 11.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange said in a statement on Thursday that its new screen-based trading system will by officially inaugurated by Sri Lankan President Chandrika Kumaratunga Bandaranaike on August 11.</p>
<p>The stock exchange has been carrying out extensive tests on the new system during trading hours in past weeks and a stock exchange official said all brokers were expected to be online by the time of the official opening.</p>
</text>
